  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Symposium for Russian experts on international commercial arbitration in Stockholm. Ten russian specialits are invited to Stockholm in order to participate. The role of the arbitrator and the counsel in the international commercial arbitration will be discussed as well as possible conflicts of interest.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Symposium f&#xf6;r ryska skiljedomsexperter i Stockholm. Tio ryka skiljedomsexperter kommer att delta, och aktuella fokus &#xe4;r; &quot;The role of the arbitrator in international commercial arbitration&quot;, The role of the counsel in international commercial arbitration&quot;, &quot;Conflicts of interest in international arbitration&quot; etc.</narrative>
  </description>
